$DEF,REM,;
$REM,<This is a comment.>;
Comments can be used $REM,
;to break long lines without affecting the output.

$DEF,lquote,<$VAL,a,$DEF,a,$BIN,60;;;>;
$DEF,rquote,<$VAL,a,$DEF,a,$BIN,62;;;>;
$DEF,bug,<$rquote;<$>$lquote;>;
An old Pakman colone, SP21, used this shape to represent the character
on a VT52 screen: $bug; Frequent players called it a cockroach.
